16ff9dfc351"} {"question" "q-335092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At})=A\\,{e}^{At}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{At}) & =A\\,{e}^{At} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}{e}^{5t} & t{e}^{5t} \\\\ 0 & {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5{e}^{5t} & (5t+1){e}^{5t} \\\\ 0 & 5{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14058518/state.json" "file_sha256" "399b2a4cb52da66a546cfbb43cdfdb6df844253a0b0020094008416ff9dfc351"} {"question" "q-335092" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14058518/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "301f6706f2d15d9c1bc5e5f66232fbd44dd9ad2062d3bd1edaa180642d2c4278"} {"question" "q-335092" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14058518/state.json" "file_sha256" "399b2a4cb52da66a546cfbb43cdfdb6df844253a0b0020094008416ff9dfc351"} {"question" "q-335092" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "5e^{5t}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14058518/state.json" "file_sha256" "399b2a4cb52da66a546cfbb43cdfdb6df844253a0b0020094008416ff9dfc351"} {"question" "q-335092" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/d